## Your Task

Evaluate each paper abstract for relevance to improving Decide. Focus on:
- Information retrieval techniques applicable to meeting search, document retrieval, or knowledge management
- AI/NLP techniques for summarization, entity extraction, topic modeling, or sentiment analysis
- Collaboration and decision-making research with computational applications
- Recommendation systems applicable to surfacing relevant context during decisions
- Real-time processing techniques for live meeting analysis

Score each paper 1-10:
- 1-3: Not relevant to Decide
- 4-5: Tangentially related, unlikely to yield actionable improvements
- 6-7: Moderately relevant, could inspire improvements
- 8-10: Highly relevant, directly applicable technique or finding

Be selective. Most papers will score 1-5. Only score 6+ if there is a clear path to application.
